WEBVTT

00:02.550 --> 00:04.060
Purification!

00:06.020 --> 00:07.700
What was that for?!

00:07.700 --> 00:10.360
Hey, you made it out alive!

00:10.810 --> 00:13.570
You disappeared into
the labyrinth for half a day,

00:13.570 --> 00:16.310
so I figured you'd become a zombie.

00:17.150 --> 00:19.260
<i>Is this guy kind of an airhead?</i>

00:20.250 --> 00:22.960
<i>I was brought to the labyrinth on assignment.</i>

00:22.960 --> 00:25.710
<i>It's a den of the undead.</i>

00:26.410 --> 00:29.680
<i>My job is to defeat them.</i>

00:30.130 --> 00:33.590
<i>But even though I am, my level isn't budging.</i>

00:31.210 --> 00:33.670
<b>Job: Healer</b>

00:31.210 --> 00:33.670
<b>Age: 17</b>

00:31.210 --> 00:33.670
<b>Level: 1</b>

00:33.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>In other words, this place must really be...</i>

00:36.540 --> 00:39.180
<i>some kind of specialized training facility.</i>

00:39.180 --> 00:40.720
<i>The zombies are just illusions!</i>

00:40.720 --> 00:44.430
Why are you grinning like 
you've figured something out?

00:47.560 --> 00:51.820
<b>The Great Cleric</b>

00:48.650 --> 00:51.820
A Salaryman's <b>Path </b>to <b>Surviving Another World</b>

02:16.140 --> 02:20.530
You can exchange the magic stones
you pick up for points at the shop.

02:17.440 --> 02:22.450
#8 A Threat in the Boss Room

02:20.530 --> 02:21.760
I see.

02:23.310 --> 02:24.330
Whoa!

02:24.890 --> 02:28.290
You can purchase anything here
 with those points.

02:28.610 --> 02:31.220
They even sell exclusive spell tomes

02:31.220 --> 02:33.340
in addition to potions, magic items, and such.

02:33.340 --> 02:36.550
<i>Wow, this is just like a video game.</i>

02:37.120 --> 02:38.470
Cattleya-san!

02:38.470 --> 02:40.050
Jord-san?

02:41.030 --> 02:43.050
Is the newcomer doing all right?

02:43.960 --> 02:45.670
My name is Luciel.

02:46.620 --> 02:48.830
I'm Cattleya. Nice to meet you.

02:46.770 --> 02:52.350
Cattleya

02:49.380 --> 02:52.350
Facing the undead must have been tough.

02:52.350 --> 02:55.730
I've built up a tolerance for their like,
 so it was fine.

02:55.730 --> 02:58.190
<i>From horror movies and games and stuff.</i>

02:58.190 --> 03:00.650
My, that's rather impressive.

03:00.650 --> 03:04.070
<i>Ah, a compliment! That makes me happy.</i>

03:04.200 --> 03:06.700
Now please turn in the magic 
stones you collected today.

03:06.700 --> 03:09.350
<i>Oh... It was just a business smile.</i>

03:09.350 --> 03:11.150
Th-Thank you.

03:11.150 --> 03:13.460
Of course. I'll just be a moment.

03:14.190 --> 03:15.590
Here you go.

03:16.060 --> 03:19.010
In total, that amounted to 4,216 points.

03:19.010 --> 03:20.650
Four thousand?!

03:20.650 --> 03:23.290
Quite an impressive haul for your first day.

03:23.290 --> 03:25.680
I haven't seen earnings like that in a while.

03:25.680 --> 03:27.560
Care to buy anything?

03:27.560 --> 03:30.850
Oh... Um, let's see.

03:30.850 --> 03:33.500
Are those spell tomes for sale?

03:33.500 --> 03:34.810
Certainly.

03:35.310 --> 03:38.590
The most expensive is one million points.

03:38.590 --> 03:39.790
One million?!

03:39.790 --> 03:42.230
I won't be able to afford that for a while.

03:42.230 --> 03:45.280
You'd have to earn 250 times 
what you did today.

03:45.280 --> 03:47.040
What about those weapons?

03:47.040 --> 03:49.320
They're made from silver and holy silver,

03:49.320 --> 03:51.750
forged especially for fighting the undead.

03:52.120 --> 03:55.110
They were all crafted by dwarfs.

03:55.110 --> 03:57.340
Wow. Oh?

03:57.340 --> 04:00.810
That spear also looks nice. How much is it?

04:00.810 --> 04:03.300
Weapons are 2,500 points each.

04:03.300 --> 04:06.010
What a steal! That must be below cost.

04:06.010 --> 04:10.270
The only people who shop here 
are healers who work as exorcists.

04:10.800 --> 04:14.730
Very few of them actually know how 
to use weapons, so nobody buys these.

04:15.070 --> 04:18.440
Reselling them is forbidden by oath too. 
There's just no demand.

04:18.440 --> 04:21.960
<i>Wow! This is too perfect for me!</i>

04:21.960 --> 04:24.680
<i>It must be Monster Luck-sensei at work again!</i>

04:26.030 --> 04:28.180
Still, isn't that far too cheap?

04:28.180 --> 04:30.490
And why is there no demand?

04:30.490 --> 04:32.670
You're asking why?

04:32.670 --> 04:35.830
Surely you know healers can't recite 
spells while wielding a weapon.

04:36.170 --> 04:38.170
<i>I mean, </i>I<i> can.</i>

04:38.170 --> 04:41.630
So now it's just dead stock 
filling up the warehouse.

04:43.510 --> 04:46.010
Okay, then when I'm done with work tomorrow,

04:46.010 --> 04:48.430
I'd like to purchase a sword and spear.

04:48.430 --> 04:50.730
I don't have enough points just yet.

04:50.730 --> 04:52.950
My, you're an odd one.

04:52.950 --> 04:56.900
Fine, since you're a first-time customer, 
I'll let you have them both for 4,000 points.

04:56.900 --> 04:58.480
Will you really?!

04:59.450 --> 05:02.030
Just don't get yourself killed.

05:02.030 --> 05:03.260
Yes, ma'am!

05:03.260 --> 05:05.710
I'll be careful to start 
earning even more tomorrow!

05:05.710 --> 05:07.430
You really are an odd one.

05:10.090 --> 05:13.300
Oh, and Jord-san, good work up until now.

05:13.300 --> 05:15.150
Yeah... Right.

05:18.460 --> 05:21.240
I finished my first day on the job!

05:21.690 --> 05:25.550
I guess my next goal is that 
one-million-point tome.

05:27.490 --> 05:30.760
It's so nice to be able to see
my earnings adding up.

05:30.760 --> 05:33.970
<i>Reminds me of collecting store 
loyalty points in my past life.</i>

05:34.670 --> 05:35.560
Now...

05:36.060 --> 05:38.530
Wh-What are you doing here?

05:38.530 --> 05:39.580
Well?

05:39.580 --> 05:40.380
What?

05:40.380 --> 05:41.770
How are things going?

05:42.110 --> 05:45.240
N-No big problems so far.

05:45.240 --> 05:47.950
Is that right? That's fine, then.

05:47.950 --> 05:50.270
Thanks for worrying about me.

05:50.270 --> 05:52.040
Next, regarding your wages, they'll be

05:52.040 --> 05:54.790
deposited into your guild account
 at the start of the month.

05:54.790 --> 05:57.380
You can check the balance
 at reception downstairs.

05:57.380 --> 06:03.130
Also, if you need any equipment,
you may use what's in the storage room.

06:03.130 --> 06:04.370
Thank you!

06:04.370 --> 06:08.100
Be sure to only take what you require.

06:08.100 --> 06:09.130
All right.

06:09.130 --> 06:12.120
Moreover, make sure you eat
 three complete meals a day.

06:12.120 --> 06:14.050
Don't forget to brush your teeth afterward.

06:14.050 --> 06:15.850
And don't let yourself become a night owl.

06:15.850 --> 06:20.710
Be sure to get ample sleep,
lest you find yourself unable to focus.

06:20.710 --> 06:22.980
Your job is a matter of life or death.

06:22.980 --> 06:25.190
You lose focus, you lose your life.

06:25.190 --> 06:26.680
Never forget that.

06:26.680 --> 06:27.870
Also...

06:28.580 --> 06:30.620
Here's your clerical robe.

06:30.620 --> 06:31.410
Huh?

06:31.410 --> 06:34.040
You should wear this inside headquarters.

06:34.040 --> 06:35.990
Oh, thank you very much.

06:35.990 --> 06:37.870
<i>This is what he went out of his way for?</i>

06:37.870 --> 06:42.090
Do you fully understand what 
it means to don a clerical robe?

06:39.040 --> 06:58.850
<b>BLAH BLAH BLAH</b>

06:42.090 --> 06:45.640
God has granted us a rare gift 
in the form of recovery magic,

06:45.640 --> 06:48.730
and that gift means shouldering
 a titanic responsibility.

06:48.730 --> 06:52.360
In essence, the clerical robe is not 
merely a symbol of position or affiliation.

06:52.360 --> 06:56.410
It is also a means of reminding you
of your obligations as a healer.

06:56.410 --> 06:59.430
We are always being tested
and must never forget that even for a moment.

06:59.430 --> 07:00.190
Now, excuse me.

07:00.190 --> 07:01.820
Y-Yes, sir.

07:05.900 --> 07:08.370
Was he waiting here just to give me this?

07:09.240 --> 07:13.010
I feel like I have a better sense
 of what kind of guy he is.

07:13.010 --> 07:14.950
Or maybe not.

07:15.450 --> 07:17.450
<b>The Next Day</b>

07:21.100 --> 07:22.670
Ready to roll!

07:22.670 --> 07:26.000
I bet if Master saw me now, 
he'd beat me to a pulp.

07:22.670 --> 07:26.000
<b>Dual Spear-Sword Style</b>

07:26.000 --> 07:28.500
But I always wanted to try this!

07:28.500 --> 07:30.650
It'll be great if I can pull it off.

07:29.970 --> 07:33.260
<b>Slash!!</b>

07:30.650 --> 07:33.260
I just have to mind my form.

07:30.970 --> 07:33.260
<b>Block!!</b>

07:32.010 --> 07:33.260
<b>Thrust!!</b>

07:33.260 --> 07:35.600
<b>Day Two</b>

07:33.710 --> 07:35.870
<i>My second day of exploring the labyrinth...</i>

07:36.990 --> 07:39.370
<i>was just mapping and exploring,</i>

07:39.370 --> 07:41.560
<i>plus defeating more zombie illusions.</i>

07:41.930 --> 07:44.310
Wait, they're carrying weapons now?

07:45.260 --> 07:49.110
You collected 5,372 points?
Don't overdo it, okay?

07:49.110 --> 07:53.320
<i>On day two, I mapped all the way to 
the fifth level before I called it quits.</i>

07:53.450 --> 07:56.280
<b>Day Three\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hLevel Six</b>

07:55.850 --> 07:57.990
This is a breeze! A breeze, I tell you!

07:58.340 --> 08:00.460
I don't know how many levels there are,

08:00.460 --> 08:03.460
but at this rate, I'll conquer 
this place in a snap!

08:05.040 --> 08:09.460
The monsters here are zombie knights
 and zombie archers!

08:10.210 --> 08:13.430
Why are they getting so close
if they have bows and arrows?

08:15.550 --> 08:18.510
And you fireballs... Take this!

08:18.860 --> 08:22.480
They glow brighter before they attack,
so I'm good as long as I get to them first.

08:22.850 --> 08:26.100
Oh well, I guess it's about lunchti—

08:27.650 --> 08:28.730
Whoa!

08:28.730 --> 08:30.530
A... A trap?

08:32.360 --> 08:34.250
Oh, I know what this is!

08:34.250 --> 08:38.540
It's their way of warning me, "Golly darn, 
there might be traps comin' up!"

08:38.540 --> 08:40.260
That's so nice of them!

08:40.260 --> 08:42.910
<i>Not</i>! I'd better make note of this.

08:46.120 --> 08:48.110
A mob of zombies?!

08:48.110 --> 08:49.670
Purification!

08:52.920 --> 08:54.680
<b>Exploring the Labyrinth, Day Three and Beyond</b>

08:54.680 --> 08:57.640
<i>After that, the number of monsters increased</i>

08:57.960 --> 09:00.550
<i>and I become very cautious about traps,</i>

08:58.350 --> 08:59.600
<i>Trap</i>

08:59.600 --> 09:00.850
<i>Mapping</i>

09:00.550 --> 09:02.980
<i>which slowed my pace.</i>

09:02.980 --> 09:05.770
<i>But nothing out of the ordinary happened,</i>

09:05.770 --> 09:08.900
<i>so I just kept on exploring, bit by bit.</i>

09:08.900 --> 09:10.270
Okay.

09:10.270 --> 09:11.610
<i>Well, there was one development.</i>

09:11.610 --> 09:14.700
<i>My points started reaching new heights,</i>

09:14.700 --> 09:16.970
<i>even though my level stayed stuck at 1.</i>

09:14.700 --> 09:17.320
<b>Name:\h\h\h\h\hLuciel</b>

09:14.700 --> 09:17.320
<b>Job:\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hHealer</b>

09:14.700 --> 09:17.320
<b>Age:





Level:</b>

09:17.450 --> 09:20.780
<b>Day Ten, Level Ten</b>

09:22.240 --> 09:23.580
Purification!

09:26.040 --> 09:30.040
<i>Yikes! Purification is 
basically a cheat spell.</i>

09:30.380 --> 09:32.690
<i>Twenty zombies cleaned up just like that.</i>

09:32.690 --> 09:35.010
<i>It's like a discount sale on magic stones!</i>

09:35.690 --> 09:40.920
Okay. It's about time I find 
a staircase to the next level down.

09:42.130 --> 09:43.140
Wuh?

09:47.690 --> 09:50.290
Is that... a boss room?

09:50.690 --> 09:52.600
Maybe I'll go back for a bit.

09:55.240 --> 09:57.980
What appears in the boss room?

09:57.980 --> 10:00.370
"Boss room"? What do you mean?

10:00.370 --> 10:02.070
Um, well...

10:02.070 --> 10:04.080
<i>I guess they don't call them "bosses."</i>

10:04.510 --> 10:06.840
It looks like it houses a strong monster.

10:06.840 --> 10:10.600
Ah, where the big group 
of them suddenly attacks you?

10:10.600 --> 10:13.920
<i>A big group?! Of bosses?!</i>

10:13.920 --> 10:16.680
Wait, you've already gotten that far?

10:16.680 --> 10:21.040
I only made it there right 
before I passed the job on to you.

10:21.040 --> 10:21.970
Huh?

10:22.640 --> 10:24.140
<b>Day Eleven</b>

10:24.140 --> 10:27.800
I'm good to go, my magic's good
 to go, and my gear's good to go.

10:27.800 --> 10:29.520
Time to do this thing!

10:29.520 --> 10:32.310
I even bought a new bow for the boss battle.

10:32.310 --> 10:35.070
That will be 50,000 points, please!

10:32.310 --> 10:35.070
<b><i>50k points</i></b>

10:35.070 --> 10:39.070
I wonder if I clear this place
by taking the boss out.

10:39.070 --> 10:42.280
I keep thinking about how long
 it took Jord-san to get here.

10:42.280 --> 10:46.470
Maybe not many folks
have conquered the labyrinth.

10:46.870 --> 10:51.120
<i>I mean, if it's a training ground 
for newbies, that would check out.</i>

10:51.120 --> 10:53.000
<i>Maybe...</i>

10:53.000 --> 10:56.090
<i>I'll be the fastest person 
to make it through!</i>

10:56.090 --> 10:59.160
<i>I hope I receive a fabulous reward!</i>

10:56.090 --> 10:59.970
Prize Money

10:59.970 --> 11:01.990
This is gonna be fun!

11:01.990 --> 11:05.940
Maybe if I clear this, I can 
get back to Merratoni early.

11:06.520 --> 11:09.290
All right! Now for a little liquid courage.

11:12.570 --> 11:13.980
Disgusting!

11:18.570 --> 11:19.900
It's so dark.

11:41.680 --> 11:46.810
I heard there would be a big group 
but I didn't expect this many!

11:46.810 --> 11:50.770
<i>Nah, this is no big deal. 
Keep your cool, dude.</i>

11:51.150 --> 11:54.480
<i>I may be surrounded,
but they didn't take me by surprise.</i>

11:56.260 --> 11:58.190
O holy touch of healing.

11:58.190 --> 12:00.530
O breath of the mother of this great land.

12:00.530 --> 12:04.160
I beseech you, protect our bodies from harm

12:04.160 --> 12:08.740
and return these unclean beings 
to the path from whence they came.

12:09.270 --> 12:10.820
Purification!

12:12.880 --> 12:14.580
Purification!

12:15.710 --> 12:17.340
Why...? What gives?!

12:19.340 --> 12:20.810
Stay away!

12:20.810 --> 12:23.530
Damn it! Is my magic blocked here?!

12:23.530 --> 12:26.930
<i>Are you trying to keep me
from my fabulous prize money?!</i>

12:26.930 --> 12:30.140
<i>No... This is because I got
too full of myself.</i>

12:31.700 --> 12:35.310
<i>I'm not the hero of the story. I'm no genius.</i>

12:35.310 --> 12:37.970
<i>I should have taken the time 
to gather information.</i>

12:37.970 --> 12:40.110
<i>I totally brought this on myself.</i>

12:41.900 --> 12:43.270
Ouch!

12:43.270 --> 12:45.020
<i>Why does it hurt if it's an illusion?</i>

12:45.020 --> 12:46.210
<i>Phantom pain?</i>

12:46.210 --> 12:48.810
All right, which one of you scratched me?!

12:48.810 --> 12:51.040
That hurt, I tell you!

12:53.460 --> 12:54.540
<i>This isn't so bad.</i>

12:54.540 --> 12:58.500
<i>Master Brod's training was 
a lot more painful and scary!</i>

12:58.500 --> 13:02.760
<i>I can't cast spells right now,
but I can still channel them into my weapon.</i>

13:02.760 --> 13:04.650
<i>I've got this. I can win.</i>

13:14.890 --> 13:17.320
Phew. They're all gone.

13:18.710 --> 13:21.860
I'm so tired. I want to use heal.

13:21.860 --> 13:27.070
<i>But even now, if Master told me 
to start running, I'd probably do it.</i>

13:27.450 --> 13:29.980
I'm so glad I had him train me.

13:29.980 --> 13:32.080
When I get paid, I should 
send him something nice.

13:32.080 --> 13:35.870
All right. It'll be a pain,
but I need to pick up these stones.

13:35.870 --> 13:38.750
Then once I get out of here, 
I'll use recover—

13:38.750 --> 13:39.850
Whoa!

13:43.520 --> 13:46.300
What the? There's another one?

13:50.530 --> 13:53.800
Is that... a wight?

13:58.400 --> 14:01.010
<i>So the mob before wasn't the boss battle?</i>

14:02.620 --> 14:05.180
O-Ouch... Heal!

14:06.010 --> 14:07.740
<i>It's still not working!</i>

14:08.950 --> 14:10.160
Damn it!

14:11.700 --> 14:15.670
He was serious about dodging that.
So he wants to keep away from it?

14:15.670 --> 14:16.580
In that case...

14:19.680 --> 14:23.130
<i>That's it! He's afraid 
of holy silver weapons!</i>

14:23.130 --> 14:26.750
<i>Surely you know healers can't recite 
spells while wielding a weapon.</i>

14:27.120 --> 14:31.220
<i>That's because using magic requires 
imagination and concentration.</i>

14:31.600 --> 14:34.760
<i>Maybe it's different with the undead,</i>

14:34.760 --> 14:38.180
<i>but that might be my clue
to defeating this wight.</i>

14:38.180 --> 14:42.040
<i>Right when he casts a spell, 
that's my chance!</i>

14:45.480 --> 14:48.370
Ooh, talk about a death glare.

14:48.370 --> 14:50.610
Must be tough carrying so much rage.

14:51.110 --> 14:54.330
Staying angry all the time 
just wears people out.

14:54.330 --> 14:57.700
Ah, but you're a monster!

15:03.840 --> 15:04.750
Now's my chance!

15:11.230 --> 15:14.930
Normally, that'd be enough to finish you off.

15:20.270 --> 15:22.690
<i>But whoever built this 
labyrinth is a real scoundrel,</i>

15:22.690 --> 15:28.150
<i>so of course I knew
you wouldn't go down that easily!</i>

15:31.410 --> 15:33.490
<i>Don't you dare regenerate this time!</i>

15:40.790 --> 15:42.460
Whew.

15:42.460 --> 15:44.400
Let's try it now. Heal!

15:45.780 --> 15:48.340
Yes! It worked!

15:48.340 --> 15:53.090
I guess video game logic 
applies to fantasy worlds.

15:53.090 --> 15:56.280
Like, you can't use magic
 until after you beat the boss.

15:56.280 --> 15:59.830
Oh well. Time to pack up 
the magic stones and loot.

16:02.810 --> 16:04.500
That should do it.

16:09.470 --> 16:10.990
A staircase?

16:10.990 --> 16:13.240
There's more to this place after all.

16:13.620 --> 16:17.140
But for now, I think I'll grab
 a bite and head back.

16:21.820 --> 16:23.740
Cattleya-san, hello!

16:23.740 --> 16:26.970
Oh my. I don't usually see you
 around at this hour.

16:26.970 --> 16:28.950
I had a tough run today.

16:28.950 --> 16:31.290
It does take a while to get used to.

16:31.290 --> 16:32.550
Just don't overdo it.

16:32.550 --> 16:36.110
Also, I have something 
I'd like to show you later.

16:36.110 --> 16:37.950
Oh? What could it be?

16:39.510 --> 16:40.520
What's all this?!

16:40.520 --> 16:43.950
There was a big horde of undead 
in the level ten boss room.

16:43.950 --> 16:46.190
Did you say... level ten?

16:46.190 --> 16:50.350
Yes. I couldn't even use magic, 
so I totally panicked.

16:50.350 --> 16:53.900
I somehow got rid of them, 
but then a wight appeared.

16:53.900 --> 16:57.120
I really thought I was a goner!

16:57.120 --> 16:59.110
Why are you being so reckless?

17:00.760 --> 17:01.760
<i>Scary!</i>

17:02.120 --> 17:04.530
I didn't think I was.

17:04.530 --> 17:07.250
I didn't expect to encounter
 something like that.

17:07.250 --> 17:09.330
And I had no idea my magic wouldn't work...

17:09.330 --> 17:11.250
Didn't you go through orientation?

17:11.250 --> 17:15.460
W-Well, it's only my eleventh
 day on the post.

17:15.460 --> 17:20.070
And labyrinth crawling is 
an exorcist's job, right?

17:21.560 --> 17:25.610
Yes, you're right. I'm sorry I got so upset.

17:26.000 --> 17:28.150
I'll go exchange your magic stones.

17:28.150 --> 17:29.460
Thank you.

17:33.320 --> 17:35.560
Okay, here are your points for today.

17:35.560 --> 17:38.070
You earned a total of 108,914.

17:38.070 --> 17:40.280
Huh?!

17:40.280 --> 17:42.550
I think that's too many digits.

17:42.550 --> 17:43.910
No, it's accurate.

17:43.910 --> 17:46.040
<i>Maybe that really </i>was<i> a boss.</i>

17:43.910 --> 17:46.040
<b>That</b>

17:46.410 --> 17:49.580
Now, didn't you say
you had something to show me?

17:49.580 --> 17:51.000
Oh, yes!

17:51.980 --> 17:54.700
The wight I killed was wearing this.

17:56.720 --> 17:59.180
I have no way to assess the value myself.

17:59.180 --> 18:00.650
This can't be...

18:00.650 --> 18:02.890
I also have the wight's staff.

18:03.230 --> 18:05.890
Pack these in your bag and follow me.

18:05.890 --> 18:07.350
What? Oh!

18:07.350 --> 18:09.470
And change into your clerical robe.

18:09.470 --> 18:10.310
Huh?

18:10.310 --> 18:12.520
Pack this? And change?

18:12.520 --> 18:13.400
Hurry up!

18:13.400 --> 18:14.280
Yes, ma'am!

18:17.240 --> 18:21.060
<i>Isn't this place off-limits to me?</i>

18:21.060 --> 18:23.330
Your Holiness, it's Cattleya.

18:23.330 --> 18:25.330
<i>"Your Holiness"?!</i>

18:25.330 --> 18:27.830
There is an urgent matter I wish to share.

18:27.830 --> 18:30.960
<i>Someone this important and she 
doesn't even have an appointment?!</i>

18:31.640 --> 18:33.500
<i>I'll allow it. Enter.</i>

18:34.150 --> 18:38.170
<i>Cattleya-san must be 
more than a mere shop lady.</i>

18:48.500 --> 18:51.070
Cattleya, it is good to see you.

18:51.070 --> 18:51.770
Your Holiness.

18:51.770 --> 18:55.480
But I don't know your companion. 
What brings you here?

18:52.110 --> 18:55.480
The Pope

18:55.480 --> 18:57.040
<i>A woman?</i>

18:57.410 --> 19:00.160
This individual is our new exorcist.

19:00.700 --> 19:02.230
Since taking his position,

19:02.230 --> 19:06.010
he has vanquished a remarkable 
number of undead in the labyrinth.

19:06.010 --> 19:10.660
Is that so? Still, I suspect there is more.

19:11.150 --> 19:14.630
Today, he fought the wight 
in the main chamber of level ten.

19:14.630 --> 19:19.240
Before he knew it, 
his magic was being suppressed there.

19:19.240 --> 19:21.130
Are you certain of that?

19:21.130 --> 19:22.390
Yes.

19:22.390 --> 19:26.330
He was successfully able 
to retrieve the wight's items.

19:26.720 --> 19:30.040
After assessing them,
 I've determined the validity of his claims,

19:30.040 --> 19:32.320
so I've brought the items here to you.

19:32.320 --> 19:33.320
Hmm.

19:34.440 --> 19:36.660
I will allow you to speak.

19:36.660 --> 19:39.220
Sir, what is your name?

19:40.320 --> 19:42.280
I am Luciel.

19:42.280 --> 19:46.580
Very well, Luciel. 
Show me what you retrieved.

19:47.560 --> 19:48.830
Please place them here.

19:48.830 --> 19:50.220
Y-Yes.

19:56.250 --> 20:02.140
These undoubtedly belong to Ozanario, 
who disappeared twelve years ago.

20:02.600 --> 20:04.970
Thank you for bringing them back.

20:04.970 --> 20:09.460
This spirit necklace reduces 
magic consumption by half,

20:09.880 --> 20:17.570
and the staff of disruption disperses 
your magic, disabling the magic of others.

20:17.570 --> 20:19.670
It is a very powerful staff.

20:19.670 --> 20:22.070
<i>Talk about cheat items!</i>

20:22.470 --> 20:26.330
Luciel, I would like to 
purchase these from you.

20:26.330 --> 20:27.150
Huh?

20:29.980 --> 20:32.000
<i>Her eyes are telling me not to refuse!</i>

20:32.350 --> 20:35.530
<i>But maybe I can make one proposal.</i>

20:35.530 --> 20:38.590
<i>Time to use the business skills 
I cultivated in my previous life!</i>

20:38.960 --> 20:42.650
I believe those items must have 
strong sentimental value for you.

20:43.220 --> 20:45.680
So I agree. I will relinquish them to you.

20:45.680 --> 20:49.140
Good. You have my thanks, Luciel.

20:49.140 --> 20:50.310
However...

20:50.310 --> 20:51.140
Hmm?

20:51.140 --> 20:54.680
Please forgive my brashness,
but I would like to make a request.

20:54.680 --> 20:55.470
What?

20:55.470 --> 20:57.230
Very well. I will hear it.

20:57.630 --> 21:02.940
When I am exploring, the magic bag I have 
doesn't carry enough. It's inconvenient.

21:02.940 --> 21:07.860
If possible, could you provide me 
a magic bag with a larger capacity?

21:07.860 --> 21:09.910
Is that all you want?

21:09.910 --> 21:12.080
In that case, do not worry.

21:12.080 --> 21:15.660
Instead of a magic bag, 
I shall give you a magic sack.

21:16.580 --> 21:20.530
Inside is an alternate dimension 
where time has stopped,

21:20.530 --> 21:22.550
so it can hold as much as this room.

21:22.550 --> 21:25.390
You can also tell what's inside.

21:25.390 --> 21:26.830
<i>That's so generous!</i>

21:26.830 --> 21:30.160
Am I truly worthy of such a gift?

21:30.160 --> 21:31.260
Fret not.

21:32.070 --> 21:35.520
This is beneficial for myself as well.

21:36.240 --> 21:39.280
If you find something else 
while exploring the labyrinth,

21:39.280 --> 21:41.290
return with Cattleya to see me.

21:41.290 --> 21:43.780
You will be presented with a reward.

21:45.110 --> 21:48.080
I will leave the magic sack with Cattleya.

21:48.440 --> 21:50.780
You may retrieve it tomorrow.

21:50.780 --> 21:53.830
I appreciate your efforts, Luciel.

21:53.830 --> 21:54.700
Thank you.

21:57.420 --> 22:00.490
You sure do keep a cool head.

22:01.060 --> 22:02.340
Do I?

22:02.730 --> 22:06.470
Requesting something in exchange 
when making an offering to the pope...

22:06.470 --> 22:07.800
Most people wouldn't dare.

22:08.470 --> 22:10.550
Maybe it was a little <i>too</i> bold.

22:10.550 --> 22:12.340
I think it was fine.

22:12.340 --> 22:15.850
She liked you enough to give 
you a magic sack, after all.

22:16.290 --> 22:17.780
So you can relax.

22:17.780 --> 22:19.410
O-Okay.

22:19.410 --> 22:24.040
<i>Except when you look at me like that, 
I can't relax at all!</i>

23:55.550 --> 23:57.450
Goodness, what is wrong with him?

23:57.450 --> 24:01.460
He clears the boss room on level ten 
and then strikes a deal with the pope?

24:01.460 --> 24:04.210
I'm so nervous, I can't take my eyes off him!

24:02.420 --> 24:04.210
<i><b>LOOM</b></i>

24:04.210 --> 24:06.420
Next time: "Training with 
the Paladin Regiment."

24:05.040 --> 24:09.900
#9 Training with the Paladin Regiment

24:06.420 --> 24:08.310
Could this be the beginnings of love?!

24:08.310 --> 24:09.880
Nah, not a chance. Never.
